exports[`frodo config export "frodo config export --all-separate --read-only --no-metadata --default --directory exportAllTestDir3 --use-string-arrays --no-decode --no-coords --extract --separate-mappings": should export everything, including default scripts, into separate files in the directory exportAllTestDir3 with scripts extracted, no decoding variables, no journey coordinates, separate mappings, and using string arrays: exportAllTestDir3/global/idm/managed/bravo_application.managed.json 1`] = `
