exports[`frodo config export "frodo config export -RAD exportAllTestDir5 --include-active-values": should export everything including secret values into separate files in the directory exportAllTestDir5: exportAllTestDir5/realm/root-bravo/script/Bravo-endUserUIClient-OIDC-Claims-Script.script.json 1`] = `
{
